{title: 014 - Let Us Praise the Name of the Lord}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #014 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 14}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Let us praise the name of the Lord!
Give Him glory, Amen.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Go ye into all the world.
Alleluia, Amen.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Amen, amen,
Amen, amen.
{end_of_verse}
